FTX+AAI+++PROFESSIONAL BUSINESS MODEL: We are a pure professional B2B wholesaler connecting Southeast Asian manufacturing directly with qualified retailers across Europe. This model has been operating successfully for 9 years, delivering competitive prices and reliable service to our retail partners. No direct consumer sales – this is standard B2B practice to protect retailer margins and is fully compliant.

